    18	       (b) part_pose  : 5 pose-anchored part vectors + per-part visibility
    19	       (c) part_grid  : 5 horizontal-band part vectors (uniform, no pose)
    20	  3. Score:
    21	       (a) cosine distance on holistic vector
    22	       (b)/(c) part-MaxSim: only common-visible parts, per-part cosine, averaged
    23	  4. eval_func (utils.metrics) -> mAP/R1, two slices: all-query, heavy-occ (vis<=8).
    24	
